<title>PHILIPPINES: Fortune sets cash, stock dividends.</title>
<headline>Fortune sets cash, stock dividends.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fortune Cement Corp said on Thursday its board had declared a 10 centavo cash dividend and a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>Shareholders as of May 23 will be eligible for both dividends, the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The payment dates have yet to be set.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
